    "change": "bookkeeping-innovatiebox-administratie",
    "adr": "ADR-037 modular register fragment — never edit shillinq_register.json",
    "description": "Tier 4 — Innovatiebox administratie (Wet Vpb art. 12b-12bg). Declares the five interconnected registers QualifyingAsset (kwalificerend immaterieel activum with validated toegangsticket), NexusCalculation (OECD BEPS Action 5 modified nexus per asset per boekjaar, immutable), IBProfitAttribution (per-asset winsttoerekening: afpelmethode / forfaitair / cost-plus), IBExpenseAllocation (kostentoerekening with doorsnijdingsverbod flag), and CarryForwardLoss (asset-specific voortwenteling verlies). The declarative x-openregister-aggregations document the nexus / profit-attribution / loss-carry-forward / doorsnijdingsverbod shapes; the PHP service layer (NexusCalculationService, ProfitAttributionService, CarryForwardLossService, DoorsnijdingsVerbodValidator, QualifyingAssetValidator, InnovatieboxAggregationService) computes the same results from the real OpenRegister ObjectService API (find/findAll). Tariff 0.09 is hard-coded per Wet Vpb art. 12b 2026 (REQ-IBA-010). Seed objects provide the worked nexus / afpelmethode / forfaitair / loss-carry-forward examples from spec.md."
  },
